.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-record-attestation 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-record\-attestation \- Record a release\*(Aqs attestation posture and what the verifier says of each archive\*(Aqs binary
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten record attestation\fR [\fB\-\-verifier\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-binary\fR> [\fItag\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Record a release\*(Aqs attestation posture and what the verifier says of each archive\*(Aqs binary
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-binary\fR \fI<binary>\fR
The binary\*(Aqs file name inside each archive (a `.exe` suffix also matches)
.TP
\fB\-\-verifier\fR \fI<verifier>\fR
The program that downloads the release and verifies each binary (default: gh)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fItag\fR]
The release tag to judge; absent is the latest release
